    "instructions": "1. Add the bourbon, Cointreau, Angostura bitters and Peychaud’s bitters into a mixing glass with ice and stir until well-chilled.\n2. Strain into a chilled flute.\n3. Top with cold Champagne or other sparkling wine.\n3. Garnish with an orange twist.",
